# The chord playing on the keys (0.15.21, a GitHub ask): while playing, its tones lit bright and the rest of the scale dim, on the home page and
# on JAM (where it is on the screen too, in its own colour, with its name); stopped, the whole scale lit as before.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect playing 1
expect keychord 1
tap GLO
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 300
expect view 33
expect keychord 1
shot jam_chord.png
wait 8000
expect keychord 1
shot jam_chord2.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
expect dimkeys 0
